<title>USA: TABLE-CRIIMI MAE Inc Q2 shr $0.28 vs $0.26.</title>
<headline>TABLE-CRIIMI MAE Inc Q2 shr $0.28 vs $0.26.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.21</p>
<p> Net			 10,412		    6,392</p>
<p> Revs			30,847		   25,406</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,747		   30,407</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
