<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: All periods ended June 30.</p>
<p>Results shown are reported on a consolidated basis, with per-share earnings reported acccording to GAAP.</p>
<p>On a tax basis, per-share earnings were $0.28 in Q2 1997 and $0.26 in Q2 1996.</p>
<p>On a tax basis, per-share earnings were $0.79 in the first half of 1997 and $0.74 in the first half of 1996.</p>
